From 246a70bdbfac3bd45ff71c7941deef1bb206b19a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Felt <jeremy.felt@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Dec 2018 23:01:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Media: Improve verification of MIME file types.

Built from https://develop.svn.wordpress.org/branches/5.0@43988


git-svn-id: http://core.svn.wordpress.org/branches/5.0@43820 1a063a9b-81f0-0310-95a4-ce76da25c4cd
---
