From c0d3a8572974a20ea6cee42da11c614a54f100e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Matthias=20O=C3=9Fwald?=
 <1410947+matz3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 29 Jan 2021 10:48:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [BREAKING] Security: Disable JavaScript execution in Less.js

Execution of JavaScript code located in *.less files is unexpected in
the context of OpenUI5 / SAPUI5 development and poses a security threat.

BREAKING CHANGE:
Parser option `javascriptEnabled` has been removed. JavaScript is always
disabled and cannot be enabled.
