From 74904f539347b7d1f8c5b5fb9e28d62ff251ee00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guy Sartorelli <36352093+GuySartorelli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jan 2025 10:24:36 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] [CVE-2024-53277] Sanitise form messages against XSS attacks
 (#11555)

Includes some new additional XSS protection inspired by Symfony
---
